darvanu mercenary mercenaries~
He looks you over with a grim expression on his face and says, "Frankly,
anyone that can wear the badge of the Darvanu with sufficient dignity,
AND follow orders properly is generally accepted.  Pay is good, if you do
what you are told, and if you do well you can advance to a higher
position."  He laughs a cold, hollow laugh and continues, "There are some
rules.  Follow orders or be killed.  Traitors are tortured to death and
then sent bodily to a random plane of hell.  Oh, and dualing within the
ranks is permitted as long as there aren't any important battles going on.
If you think you are tough enough to join up, go and find yourself a
badge."  He dismisses you with a wave and an evil grin.
~
