M
old quarter~
The leader nods

"Some time ago, a skeletal necromancer decided to make the old quarter
his home.  Masses of undead are proliferating there, and we're concerned
that the evil will spread elsewhere.  You've got to help us.  Take out
the necromancer and bring me his remains!

Before that, I require you to show proof that you will stand a chance
against this deadly foe.  You must clear the entire old quarter in
addition to showing me proof that Lord Braddistock is gone.  I require
the following:

Proof that Lord Braddistock is gone.

The remains of all the former guildmasters of Tharnadia.  They are found
in Tharnadia's old quarter.

The remains of the zombie beast found in the old mansion in the northern
part of Tharnadia's old quarter."
~
M
braddistock~
