fate future~
&+cSeptimus looks at you with sadness in his eyes and says "&+wMore than one of my
&+wmen has come to me with concerns about the path I have chosen for our tribe.
&+wPerhaps two months ago, two men arrived in the camp with a proposition.
&+w'Offer us food and shelter,' they said, 'and we shall create for you weapons
&+wthe likes of which your people have never seen.' My people do not tradition-
&+wally use arms in combat, but I have been told in my dreams that the twelve
&+wtribes of Cimmeria are to battle the army of Zalkapfaan before the year is
&+wout. I accepted their offer, cleared a wagon for each of them, and made camp
&+where for as long as they needed.
        &+c"&+wSure enough, a few days passed and they brought me a beautiful
&+wfalchion with an iron blade and hardwood handgrip, that glowed with power.
&+wThey then whisked it out of my hands and said they needed it in order to
&+wmake duplicates. I thought nothing of it at the time, but now... One of my
&+wmost trusted men has left the camp in disgust, and another has gone missing.
&+wI cannot break my word as a Cimmerian to these newcomers, but if I were to
&+whave evidence that they were dabbling in evil arts, I would then be bound
&+wto smite them under the laws of Winduin. Bring me such evidence and you
&+wshall be handsomely rewarded.&+c"
~
QA
&+cSeptimus examines the shards closely, calling upon his Immortal blood to
&+cgive him powers of discernation far beyond those of mortal men. After a time
&+che straightens up and says "&+wIt is apparent that these materials are from
