&+wliving creatures. My worst fears are realized: they are using MY hospitality
&+wto conduct evil rituals and spread their evil among my people. I do not know
&+wwhether I could inspire the loyalty in my people to evict the newcomers, any
&+wlonger; if I could ask you to do this task, I will give you the most valuable
&+wthing I own. As collateral for the work you have already accomplished, I
&+woffer you this ring. Bring it back along with proof that the strangers are
&+wno more, and I will touch you with the power of Winduin himself.&+c"
~
