reading a few lines, her face begins to soften, and by the end, she is
smiling.

"Thank you, my friends.  You have done me a great service today.  Here, let
me reward you with a gift.  I have here a potion which I know nothing about.
It was brought to me by a traveller, claiming it came from some far away
human continent, but I have yet to deduce what its effects are.  I give it
to you, both as thanks, and in the hope you can determine what it is."

She frowns slightly, then continues,

"Your deed is worth more to me than one potion with unknown effects. Here,
let me give you another potion that I've been tinkering with.  I assure you
that you will enjoy the benefits of this one."

She smiles merrily, and hands you the potion.
~
