"I thought I would never see this beauty again.  I can see that you are a
capable adventurer. Perhaps you can do me another favor.  I have drafted a
letter to give to Severne, but she has yet to accept it.  Perhaps you could
deliver it to her?  I thank you from my heart."

He smiles, flips the dagger into the air, and watches it twirl. As it makes
its descent, you see his hand dart into your inventory and place an object
there, just before he snatches the dagger hilt first from midair.
