M
hello hi name~
Marja says "Name?  Why, my name is Marja.  Most folks around here know me.
I make most of the clothes for the people in these parts.  Nice to meet you,
and what can I be doing for you today?"
~
M
father mage tower towers mages magic~
Marja's face gets darkly cloudy for a few moments.  Then, with controlled
calm she says politely, "I would rather not talk about that, if you don't
mind."
~
M
son sons~
Marja says "My sons?  You met my sons?  Darling boys, never gave me a bit of
trouble.  Best tanners in these parts, too.  If you need any hides or furs,
you talk to them."
~
M
husband~
Marja says "My husband?  Did you meet him outside?  It isn't so easy for him
these days, since the boys took to the woods.  I know he would rather be out
hunting, like they do, but someone has to look after the farm."
~
M
clothing clothes~
Marja says "Clothing?  Yes I do make clothing, from the skins and furs of
the forest creatures.  What would you like me to make for you?"
~
M
jacket~
Marja says "A jacket?  Yes I can make you a very beautiful buckskin jacket.
I would need 4 buckskins, and 2 rabbit pelts for the lining.  It would cost
you 30 gold pieces for my work."
~
M
pants~
Marja says "Pants?  Certainly I can make you some pants. If you would bring
me 4 doeskins, and 20 gold pieces for my work, I will make you a pair."
~
M
boots~
Marja says "Boots?  Of course I can make boots, very nice ones too, lined
with fur.  Very comfortable for walking long distances.  I would need the
skins of 2 deer, as well as 4 rabbit pelts for the lining.  I will make you
a pair for 30 gold pieces."
~
M
cape~
Marja says "Cape?  My you do have good taste don't you.  I can make you a
very beautiful fox fur cape, that will not only protect you, but keep you
warm as well.  I would need 10 fox pelts, however, and I would have to get
100 gold pieces for my work.  But you would have a cape to be proud of."
~
M
belt~
Marja says "A belt?  I can make you a very nice belt from the skins of 2
rattlesnakes.  It will only cost you 10 gold pieces."
~
M
cap~
Marja says "A cap?  Well, now, the best caps are made from the fur of the
raccoon.  I would only need 1 fur, and only 10 gold for my work as well."
~
M
backpack~
Marja says "Backpack?  Oh ny yes, I can make a backpack big enough to carry
anything a traveler really needs.  I make them from the hides of wolves.
Only takes 2, and 20 gold for my time."
~
M
buck buckskin~
Marja says "Buckskin?  Why, I can make you a very beautiful jacket out of
buckskin. I would need 4 buckskins, and 2 rabbit pelts for the lining.  It
would cost you 30 gold pieces for my work."
~
M
doe doeskin~
Marja says "Doeskin?  Certainly I can make you something with doeskin. If
you would bring me 4 doeskins, and 20 gold pieces for my work, I will make
you a very nice pair of doeskin pants."
~
M
deer deerskin~
