M
hi hello~
The sprite looks up at you for a moment with tear-filled eyes, then
buries her face in her hands and continues crying uncontrollably.
~
M
name~
"My name is Glor-Linda," she tells you between sobs.
~
M
crying matter~
The little sprite takes a few deep breaths to try to get control of herself,
then tells you in a sobbing voice, "Those horrid pixies stole may fairy dust
and my wands.  I cannot work my magic without them."  Having said that, her
little body wracks again with sobs.  Then she looks up at you pleadingly.
"If you could recover my fairy dust, and at least one of my wands, I could
make something really nice for you.  In fact, if you bring me the feathers
of four different magical birds, as well as my fairy dust and wand, I will
make you something right away to repay you."
~
M
wand wands~
"I had several wands, but I would be happy if you could recover at least
one of them for me."
~
M
fairy dust~
"I need the fairy dust to enchant things. Please recover it for me, and I
will reward you well."
~
M
magical bird~
"There are several magical birds which inhabit these woods.  They are not
regular birds.  They fight fiercely, although their magic keeps them from
being permanently destroyed.  However, if you can best one, you might be
able to get a feather from it.  These feathers are highly magical, and if
I had four different kinds, along with my fairy dust and at least one of
my wands, I could make you something really nice."
~
Q
The little sprite twirls around you excitedly, and exclaims, "Oh thank
you for returning my fairy dust and wand.  And since you brought some
feathers as well, I can even reward you."  She works very quickly, tieing
the feathers together into an earring.  Then she sprinkles it with some of
the fairy dust from the bag, waves her little wand over it, and hands it to
you, saying "Here, I am sure you will find this useful in your travels."
~
