M
boots boot~
Eleadora raises an eyebrow.
Eleaodra tells you 'I lost my boots staying at that horrific Bone Fort Inn,
that place must be haunted or something, because I could of sworn something
was trying to kill me the whole time I stayed there. It was also unusually
warm, which raises some suspicions I have had about that place. If you
find the thief who has stolen my boots and return them to me, I will give
you a small token for your troubles.'
~
M
malinar~
Eleadora begins to cry..
Eleadora tells you 'Malinar was once a friendly giant of the north, and we
used to be great friends, but after we made the sword that I now keep in
a special hiding place he has gone on a rampage of BloodLust due to greed.
We have never made up our differences, and to this day he hunts me. I can
not let him keep going on his rampage, as he might hurt innocent people..
I have no choice but to see him dead, bring me his head, and I will let
you have this sword that has brought me all of this trouble..'
~
M
sword~
Eleadora tells you 'It was a great sword that took years to make, and is
a huge piece of magical ice that contiains enormous power. I have it hidden
away from Malinar so he won't steal it, or kill me.  This sword has brought
me NOTHING but trouble.'
~
