M
anna cottage~
Finn smiles and says "Anna?  She's just up over the the hill to the north
of here.  Make sure you check out her library there, as there are a lot of
useful things to be found there."  Finn sighs loudly and then mutters
something under his breath about his lost ring and leaving the realm...
~
M
ring home leave realm~
You can see a tear come to an eye of the Legendary Finn.  He lets out
a bellowing sigh, and says, "Alas, I've wandered this realm to its
farthest corners, helped Queen Mab in her quest to regain her throne,
but can not find my way back home to the mortal realm."  He puts on
a sheepish look and mutters under his breath, "If only I had not lost
my signet ring.."  He looks up from his musings and says, "Hmm could
you find me a teleport scroll anywhere?  I heard the Tinkers have
recently entered this realm, perhaps they have a means of me to leave..."
