sack!! Now I can make that special recipe for the elder and gain favor over
my favored sister. Here is the pay I promised you. As for the lost mine
information, I was relaxing one day in the house of Clan Potent Brew and
overheard a drunken clansdwarf bragging that he knew the location of the
entrance to the lost mine. I know not his name but he bore the tatoo of a
large eye enclosed in a circle on his forehead. That is all I know. I must
go now and prepare my special recipe for the elder!"

The young duergar quickly turns and continues her work.
~
