skill skills~
&+R"Skills, well yes those are important,"&n the rogue grins.&n
&+R"Skills are methods of survival or battle tactics and techniques that are&n
&+Rlearned by classes through use over time.&n

&+RYour proficiency at a skill will increase over time if you apply the skill&n
&+Ras you adventure. Some of the most important skills you will use are&n
&+Rbackstab, sneak, hide, track and disguise.&n

&+RA backstab is an attempt to sneak up on the victim and place a weapon in&n
&+Rthe victim's back at exactly the point where it will do the most damage.&n
&+RThe amount of damage incurred is dependent on the proficiency of the&n
&+Rbackstabber and the dice on the weapon used. You may only backstab with&n
&+Rpiercing weapons.&n

&+RSneak allows you to move silently from one place to another. A person who&n
&+Rsneaks successfully will be able to travel (for a period of time) without&n
&+Ranyone taking notice of his or her arrival or departure. As with most&n
&+Rlearned skills, there is always a chance that you will not sneak&n
&+Rsuccessfully and, with this particular command, you will be unable to tell&n
&+Rif it has worked or not. You can quit sneaking with "sneak off."&n

&+R"Hide" allows you to cleverly conceal yourself from the occupants of a room,&n
&+Rregardless of whether they are other players or creatures.&n

&+RThis allows you to track your quarry. How successfully you track down a&n
&+Rpotential victim depends on your skill level and how far away your target&n
&+Ris. You can not track down specific racewar enemies, even if you happen to&n
&+Rknow the name of a particularly notorious foe. When you have given up the&n
&+Rtrail, you must type 'track off' in order stop tailing the quarry.&n

&+RWith a proper assortment of items, a player may attempt to change their&n
&+Rappearance. With an amount of skill as well, they may actually succeed.&n
&+RThe more skill you have the more you will be able to disguise as someone&n
&+Rinstead of just race. Check local justice to see if disguise is allowed.&n
