&+L"These are the creatures you may learn to &+mraise&+L and command in time:

   &+W-&+mZombies and Skeletons
   &+W-&+mSpectres
   &+W-&+mWraiths
   &+W-&+mVampires
   &+W-&+mLiches
   &+W-&+mDracoliches
   &+W-&+mGolems

&+LI can also tell you more about how to &+mcontrol&+L them."
~
M
zombies zombie skeletons skeleton spectre spectres~
&+L"&+mZombies&+L and &+mskeletons&+L are low level warriors, only good for light tanking duty
&+Lwhile experiencing.  &+mspectres&+L are assassins with slightly higher hp than the
&+Lfirst two, and can double backstab with daggers."
~
M
wraiths wraith~
&+L"&+mWraiths&+L are &+Msorcerers&+L, and their powers increase along with yours as you
&+Lgain experience.  Though they are very frail they are undead and gain hitpoints
&+Las they do damage.  Check out &+mhelp sorcerer&+L to determine which spells wraiths
&+Lcan cast."
~
M
vampires vampire~
&+L"&+mVampires&+L are powerful warriors.  They &+mtank&+L well, do nice damage, and vampiric
&+Lregenerate off their damage.  In addition they can &+mneckbite&+L and &+mgaze&+L enemy
&+Ltargets, which can temperarily keep the target from being able to respond."
~
M
liches lich~
&+L"&+mLiches&+L are more powerful versions of &+mwraiths&+L.  They have more hitpoints, have
&+Lmore spell slots, and can cast up to even the highest of spells available to
&+Msorcerers&+L.  With undeads vampiric regeneration they can be better tanks than
&+Lvampires in some situations."
~
M
dracolichs dracolich draco dracoliches~
&+L"&+mDracoliches&+L are warriors-type dragons with a few bonuses.  They have higher
&+Lhitpoints than vampires, higher damage output, can be ordered to breath for
&+Lroom damage, and can tail-sweep to knock foes off their feet.  Also, they can
&+Lbe used as a mount by the &+mNecromancer&+L.
~
M
golems golem~
&+L"&+mGolems&+L are the &+mDia&+rbolis&+L' mega &+mtank&+L.  There are three types that
&+Lbecome more powerful as you gain experience.  These constructs are solid to the
&+Lcore and its rumored the strongest has an energy drain attack."
~
M
control command~
&+LThe &+mNecromancer&+L walks over to the undead, "To command them to do your
&+Lbidding, you will use the &+morder&+L command.  You may command a single follower at
&+Lonce, or all &+mfollowers&+L.  So if I were to &+morder followers kill deer&N, they
&+Lwould then attack the deer.  Many of your followers are capable of other
&+Lcommands as well.  Try them out and see just what each type is capable of."
~
M
innate innates~
$n &+Lrasps, "Just use the &+minnate &+Lcommand and it will
&+Ltell you what abilities the &+YG&+yo&+wd&+Ls&+L have blessed your race or chosen path with."

&+L"What else would you like to know?"
~
M
spec specs specialization~
&+LThe &+mNecromancer&+L rubs his hands together and reaches into his bookcase pulling
&+Lout a thick tomb. He looks around and makes sure nobody is looking and whispers
&+Lto you, "Did you know there is a way to obtain even more spell knowledge and
&+Lbecome more powerful?"

&+LHe opens the tomb and points to the pages...

&+L"A &+mNecromancer&+L can choose one of three different paths to specialize in.  Each
&+Lpath has its own focus upon a specific aspect of power.  The three choices are:

   &+W-&+mDia&+rbolis
   &+W-&+mNe&+Lcro&+mlyte
   &+W-&+LReap&+wer

&+LThe &+mDia&+rbolis&+L is a master of assembling flesh and bone to form constructs.
&+LTheir study of blood magic gives them the knowledge to exhume dead from the
&+Lground.

&+LThe &+mNe&+Lcro&+mlyte&+L possesses heightened senses capable of detecting the dead.
&+LHe is a high study of control and may manage a high number of undead that are
&+Lforced into irreversible submission."

&+LAnd finally the &+LReap&+wer&+L, these are experts at wielding staves and daggers.
&+LThere is no hesitation weighing into combat for these mages. They have mastered
&+Lcontrol over the necromancer's &+mvampiric trance&+L and can &+mremort&+L at will."
~
M
quest quests~
&+mTaiz&+L closes his dark book of spells and rubs his chin as he gazes at you and
&+Lponders your request. Taking your hand in his clammy one, he walks you over to
&+Lthe side of the room away from anyone else.

&+L"Through &+mdeath&+L we gain powers, if you would like to achieve these powers I can
&+Lgive you a task that will indeed make you more powerful.  First you must take
&+La &+Wlife&+L, and for many they are not ready.  Find a holyman, the more innocent the
&+Lbetter.  Bring his bones to me, with that you will prove your readiness to
&+Lembrace the dead and their powers."&n
~
