&+WI may give my family dinner tonight.  With the illness that plagues us right
&+Wnow, we are all too weak to venture far from home.  Here is a token of my
&+Wappreciation.  It isn't much but I'm sure it can be of use to you in your
&+Wtravels."&n
~
R I 29223
G I 294
G I 333
D
&+WThe man's face flashes a small smile of appreciation and he slowly begins to
&+Wleave the room, carrying his fish with him.  He stops for a moment and says,
&+W"Hrm...", and takes a seal out of a box and hands it to you.  "You may be able
&+Wto use this." He smiles and goes to tend to his child.
~
