apocalypse.  I thought you mortals had learned your lesson.  The horsemen are
too powerful.  It is best that they remain trapped in that world of agony and
despair.  If they were ever to escape, noone would be safe.  Still, the lure of
their treasure has attracted fools to challenge their world.  If you enter the
&+bportal&n, you may not be able to return.  The choice is yours."
~
