portal~
"The portal was created centuries ago to grant access to the land of the
horsemen.  It was created as a failsafe.  If ever the horsemen were to escape,
travel to their land might be neccesary.  Since then, however, the portal has
been used by treasure seekers and foolish adventurers.  If you wish to enter,
I will not stop you.  The portal requires a &+rdisplay of respect&n to be activated.
I wish you luck, and should you challenge and defeat all 4 of the horseman -
bring me proof of their demise and I will reward you with the treasures of
my predecessors."

"Oh... one more thing.  Once you enter the portal, I understand there is some
trick to leaving that area.  Unfortunately, I do not know, but many years ago
an adventuring party left to challenge the horsemen and he took with him a
note which, supposedly, held the answer"
