am afraid.  I will need you to find me the location of a small
gem that I have lost.  It belongs to my key, is my belief.'

Lord Du'Maathe fingers a key on a chain about his neck.

Lord Du'Maathe says 'It is said that the key will unlock the
secrets of the past, yet I have found no use of it in my stay
here.  It is however missing a small gem from it.  It is my
belief that the missing gem may hold the power to the key.
