in return I was awarded titles and this very castle in which
you now stand.  A hero indeed.  Well as you can see even a
hero can be defeated.  It is not uncommon in this day for
anyone to claim to be such, I myself am skeptical, maybe due
to age or just my own complacency.  I know not which.'

Lord Du'Maathe sighs loudly.

Lord Du'Maathe says 'Well I mean not to doubt you friend, but
I will require some proof of the stature you claim.  Will you
provide me with this proof?.
~
