on some major journey or ask to see any great feats, I will
set you a task close to home, and a problem that I have.  I
know it may sound selfish, but that is one of the few things
I will or am still able to endulge.  I need a potion.  The
potion I require is a fairly potent one, and one which may aid
in my rehabilitation to an extent.  The potion I require is a
'granular potion'.  Should you bring this to me, I will
consider you worthy of the title you claim.'
~
