help job work~
&+YXazapath&+L eyes you for a brief while, then lowers his voice down to whisper and
&+Lbegins telling you his story.

&+L"I was born within house &+MMaaz&+L, and served there as their huntsmaster for last
&+L four hundred years. Usualy it was rather dull work of providing fresh meat to
&+L my house. From time to time it was getting more interesting, most notably
&+L when our house was starting a war with some other clan. Such wars must be
&+L quick and silent. Otherwise Council orders all other houses to wipe out the
&+L unfortunate attacker. So with each of that wars, there was much need for my
&+L stealthy hunting skills. And it was no different with the last one."

&+YXazapath&+L stops for a moment, then continues.

&+L"I was given the task to assassinate the head mage of the enemy house Zar'Azz.
&+r I failed.&+L He dodged my arrows, he escaped my thrown blade, he lived and
&+L warned his house. So to say, they managed to defend themselves. What happened
&+L later, I do not know, but I can imagine. All remaining nobles from my old
&+L house must have been slain, all remaining troops sold. But I didn't see that,
&+L becouse I was still on the track of that goddamned mage! I was chasing him,
&+L and he was running. He made it out of Arachdrachnos, with me on his back.
&+L He was running for good three weeks, and for that three weeks I was chasing.
&+L He run into upper parts of underdark, into tunnels freshly created by some
&+L earthquake, not mapped by anyone. Finally he made his was into these tunnels.
&+r Here he met his destiny.&+L Sadly, it was not my blade that ended his misery.
&+L He got poisoned to death by a huge spiders dwelling these tunnels.
&+L Beasts cut his corpse into several parts. I gathered some of them, but I must
&+L gather more so I can offer them to &+rLloth&+L, gain her forgiveness, and return
&+L to my beloved Arachdrachnos. There I will offer service to some other house,
&+L hopefuly stronger than the one I was born in."

&+LHe finishes his talk and turns to polishing his blade. After a few moments he
&+Lseems to notice you again.

&+L"&+WNow what the hell you are still doing here!?!? GO! Go and gather all the parts
&+W of drowish corpse you can find withing these tunnels. Go NOW, till I still
&+W have patience! Success - reward. Failure - death. Even such simple being as
&+W yourself can understand that, I hope.&+L"
~
