hi hello~
&N$n grunts at $N and says &+W'Greetings, $N. I watched you board the
&+WStalval, and now you are here with me.' &Nhe says, taking a long
&Ndraw from his pipe.

&+W'I foresee you have come to aid the Tribe of the Whale. You are
&+Wan honored guest, $N.' &Nhe says, exhaling a &+Wplume&N of smoke.

&+W'Have you come to stop the rivals?'&N he asks $N.
~
MA
yes rivals stalval~
&N$n nods at $N and says &+W'Yes it is true. The Tribe of the Whale
&+Whunts the whale just the same as the rivals, but--'&N he says,
staring $N in the eyes, &+W'they kill for pleasure. They have no
&+Whonor. They have no right!' &nhe says, his nostrils flaring.

&+W'Bring me the flags of The Crimson Fulgur and The Ironhold Grudge.'
&n$n takes a truly heroic pull from his pipe, stifling a cough as
he says &+W'...and you will be part of the Tribe.' spewing a plume
of earthy smoke, filling the chamber.
~
QA
&N$n makes no change in expression as he takes the flags from $N.

&N$n bows solemnly and places a scrimshawed bracer in $N's hands.

&N$n lets out another massive &+Lplume of smoke&N that he had apparently
been holding in this whole time.
~
