&N$n glares at $N and snarls &+R'What do -you- want?'
Two burly &+Wsto&+Lrm orc &+rs&+Re&+rn&+Rt&+ri&+Rn&+re&+Rl&+rs&N lurch forward, stopped abruptly by &+RF&+ru&+ylg&+ru&+Rr.
&+R'You have one chance..&+R' &Nhe grows.

&N'I'm here to serve you, lord!' $n pleads, falling to the floor.

&N$n and the other &+Wsto&+Lrm orcs&N erupt into laughter.

&+R'Serve me? Hah!' &N he barks &+R'Serve me the blood of the rivals!'
