&N$n snatches the flags from $N before a word can be spoken and
roars in triumphant delight.

&+R'The seas are ours, boys!' &nhe bellows, causing a thunderous
roar, and some violence, from the crew.

Amidst the rabble, $n looks at his personal &+Cstorm&+cscreamer&+L,
who prepares an incantation of &+Ba&+Yr&+Bc&+Yi&+Bn&+Yg &+Belectricty:&+L a &+Ccloak&+L forms.
~
