MA
hi hello cook cooking~
&N$n nods at $N and says &+G'Grog for ya?! Keepin' their bellies
&+Gfull be just as much work as climbin' the ropes or mannin' the
&+Gballist's!'

In several quick thwacks, $n chops a tentacle into several
sections and continues &+G'Fish? They'll eat it if it's in front
&+Gof 'em, but these sailors be droolin' for land meat! I'm nay
&+Gopposed to fish meself, raised on the sea!' &n$n nods proudly.

&+G'Go &+Wfishing&+G, will ye? Catch two &+Wfish&+G and bring 'em back to me
&+Gand we'll have us &+Wfish skewers&+G, eh?!

&+GOr if ye come across a &+Whaunch of land meat&+G, maybe an &+Wolyx&+G,&+W lion&+G,
&+Wtheezak&+G, &+Wcaribou&+G, or even just a plain &+Wside of boar&+G, I'd pay ye!'
~
MA
fishing fish skewer skewers~
&n$n nods hungrily at $N and says &+G'Ye grow up on em, ye got hooked!'
&N$n lets out a boisterous laugh, causing several patrons to turn
and laugh with her.

&+G'Bring us back two fish for a skewer, but if they're the same type
&+Gof fish, I always find they come out a bit sizzlier!'&n she says.
~
MA
meat landmeat land theezak olyx lion caribou~
&N$n nods hungrily at $N and says &+G'Many of these orcs are recruits..
&+Gnot accustomed to the life at sea!' &Nshe adds loudly enough to
draw a few glares from some nearby horde.

&+G'Be that as it may, gentle $N, I'm always on the lookout for
&+Gland meat. If ye come across a bloody haunch of lion, theezak,
&+Gcaribou, olyx, or even just a plain old side of boar, I'll pay
&+Gye handsomely for it!'&N $n says.
~
