&+R'&+WYou see, during the age of the Second Coming, I was commissioned as a
&+Wprotector of the people, chosen from thousands of warriors and wizards to
&+Wseek out and destroy an unknown evil that was destroying our way of life.&+R'

&+R'&+WIt wasn't long before I had discovered that these beasts had come from deep
&+Wwithin the bowels of this universe with the purpose of exterminating anything
&+Wthat lives a peaceful existence.&+R'

&+R'&+WMy skills as a hunter quickly revealed themselves as I had them  all but slain
&+Wwhen the mighty &+gthree &+Wunited in an unholy alliance and managed to capture me.
&+WAs strong as they were, my faith to the Gods made my mortal body impossible to
&+Wslay.&+R'

&+R'&+WOnly with the help of a &+gfourth &+Wand even &+Ldarker evil &+Wwere they able to construct
&+Wa prison within the folds of time that was strong enough to contain me.&+R'

&+R'&+rSlay the dragons and bring their hearts to my &+LMORTAL &+rbody and you shall be
&+rREWARDED!&+R'
~
