"You are right, I am to old to dwell in my own sadness." He answers.  After
looking you over he continues, "Someone has slain one of my children and her
mate.  They killed them for their skins, skins which make good armor for your
kind.  These things can always happen, this I know, but what has saddened me
so deeply is that all her eggs have been lost."
~
M
egg eggs~
"My daughter and her mate had several eggs in a nest someplace in the jungle.
Like all our kind they hid the eggs in several warm, moist spots that only they
knew of.  If they are not found and properly cared for they shall wither and
die and even my grandchildren shall be lost.  You must understand, my kind are
not very fertile, for us this is the greatest loss of all.  One of my other
children is searching the jungle for them, and for the hunters that killed his
sister and her mate."  As soon as he even mentions the word 'hunters' his
body becomes tense and poised for action.
~
M
hunters hunter~
