Lord Lenbrea sighs loudly.

Lord Lenbrea says in common 'In every town there are
thieves.  Ceothia is no different.  It is something
that they police between themselves, with far more
brutality than my justice.  However at the moment it
is unacceptable.  There are four such thief guilds
operating in Ceothia, and controlling them is near
impossible.  What I want you to do is to make sure
there is only one operating in the town.  Which one
