MA
hi hello~
&N$n smiles happily and says &+G'Greetings, $N!'
&+G'Have you come to inquire about &+Rcollecting&+G or &+Rcrafting?' &N$n says, looking around $N.
&+G'Or perhaps,' &Nhe says &+G'You could do me a &+Rfavor&+G..'
~
MA
collecting collector collect~
&N$n nods at $N and says &+G'We use it all at the workshop! Bring me:

any random object, like a &+Wm&+Ya&+Wg&+Yi&+Wc&+Ya&+Wl &+rruby &+Ltunic&N
any salvaged component, like &+csome te&Nm&+cpe&Nr&+ced iron&N
any strange stone, like a &+Lstrange &+Wsharp &+rrubin&N
any recipe, like &+ya ti&+Yght&+yly &+Lrolled &+yvellum &+Yrecipe &+yfor &+Lan &+Mobs&+mid&+Mian &+Lring&N

&+G...Oh, and uh $N, we get 'lot more out of stones and recipes!' &N$n adds with a wink.
~
M
qc_action 200~
&N$n fidgets with a couple strange glass and acrylic &+Rgi&+Yz&+Bmos&N.
~
M
qc_action 200~
&N$n says to his crew '&+GTry again, don't give up!'
~
MA
favor~
&N$n nods at $N and says &+G'One of my tinkerer cousins here is a big fan of Barlow's brew.  Well, he overheard some of those brewers say they were looking to..' he gulps and continues &+W'Try to my tinkerers!'
&NHe scoffs and continues &+G'Well, we'll have to get them before they get us, eh $N?'
&+G'Return to me with five of their &+ybadges&+G, and I'll know the deed is done'&n, $n whispers with &+rbloodlust&N in his eyes.

&n$n says &+G'Another thing, $N..those &+Rmedals of honor&+G?  I'll pay ye for four of em!'
~
MA
barlow brewstash brew badges brewer brewers~
&N$n scoffs and grunts &+G'Mind poison!'
&N$n spits on the floor in front of $N and quickly apologizes.
&+G'Didn't mean to get ya!' &Nhe chuckles.
&+G'Bring me six of the brewers badges, and I'll know the deed is done.'&N he says.
~
MA
medal medals honor~
&N$n grins at $N and says &+G'Medals of Honor are rewarded all over Alatorin for certain deeds that honor the king.  Tell ya what, $N, if you bring me &+Rfour&+W of those &+Cmedals of honor&+W, I will repay you with a special &+Rtoken &+Wof &+Rgnome currency&+W!'
~
MA
craft crafting~
&n$n nods at $N and says &+G'I love crafting, $N. I've been working on these new &+Bbody enhancement mechanics&N where we can increase our own energy output from simple &+Cmechanics &Nthat attach to the body!'
With a large grin, $n continues &+G'My prototypes are finished and I'm ready to produce!  Here's what I will require:
&+Gsome &+Mte&n&+mmp&+Mer&N&+med &+Mmi&+mth&+Mril &+Garmor, which you'll find at &+CSteel&N&+cgr&+Lip's &+WDepot&N
&+Ga &+Rgn&N&+romi&+Rsh &+Lshopkeepers token&N x2
&+Wa &Nplastic &+Wbag full of &N&+gd&+Grug&N&+gs&N&+G, which you can get from a &+Ggoblin &Nin &+WDeramuth Port&N
a&+Gnd &+W50 platinum&+G for my troubles.

&+G'There are five different pieces of &+mte&+Mmpere&+md &+Cmithril &n&+marm&+Mor &+Gand thus five different pieces of &+Bbody enhancements&+G that I can craft for you, $N!' he says.
~
