MA
hi hello~
&+WThe &+CBrightAxe &+Wcook looks at you and says 'Greetings, I bet you have
&+Wdone your fair share of cooking in the past now haven't you?'
&+WThe &+CBrightAxe scoffs out a laugh and begins laughing more until he
&+Cbegins to choke.
&+W'The men are sick of this caribou meat, they have eaten these snow deers for
&+Wover two weeks now.  If you could get me enough meat, maybe some nice theezak
&+Wmeat, to feed this whole army then I will surely let you have your fair share,
&+Wfree of price, because I know you aren't in the BrightAxe military.'
&+WThe &+CBrightAxe &+Wcook winks at $N.
&+WThe &+CBrightAxe &+Wcook nods at $N and continues &+W'There is another thing,
&+WI have gotten wind that the other cooks are trying to win the King's tastes
&+Wwith their fancy cooking!  I will have no part of it, because I have my very
&+Wown recipe that will sure to beat them.  Help me with my recipe, $N!.'
~
