war~
&N$n nods at $N and continues &+Y'What side ye be on, cousin? Think ye
&+Yfinna join the great army of King Taark?  Is that why ye came here?'
~
MA
yes army king taark shanat~
&N$n nods at $N and continues &+Y'Excellent! We could use ya to uhh..'
&N$n sizes $N up and down once again, continuing &+Y'To uhh..'
&N$n walks around $N, examining every angle.
&+Y'Maybe you could..'&N $n says, now scratching his beard.
&+Y'Agh!'&N he finally exclaims. &+Y'We'll find somethin!'
&+Y'But first, the matter of your tithes..'
~
MA
tithes tithe~
&N$n smiles, perhaps for the first time this conversation.
&+Y'Glad to hear yar ready to join, $N!' &Nhe says.
&+Y'Entry fees to King Taark's Legionnaires is two thousand coins of platinum,
&+Y'and of course we would also take a gnomish shopkeeper token.' &Nhe says with a grin.
&N$n leans back on his large broadsword and says &+Y'We could use ye, $N!'
&+Y'After all, everyone in King Taark's Legion pays tithes.' he grunts matter-of-factly.
~
QA
&N$n's eyes sparkle at the sight of the &+Wcoins&N.
&+Y'Yes, YES!' &Nhe bellows, stuffing the tithes into a drawstring sack.
&+Y'Ye ARE legionnaire material, $N!' &N$n cackles.
~
