MA
jade~
After some discussion between $n and $N about their experiences with jade, $n says 'The Jade Empire, as it has been called, or so I've overheard, by orcs on the Sea Stalker.'
$n sighs, and continues &+G'I am not a violent man, $N, but the citizens of the Jade Empire are monopolizing this precious stone.  You are so impressed by these &+Geyes &Nbecause they are of a rock you so rarely see!'
&+G'There are certain highlanders that patrol the island of &n&+gJade&+G.  These highlanders force out all excavation operations that are not immediately affiliated with the &N&+gJade &+GEmpire.  Well, it is unfortunate that it has come to this, but we have no choice but to force the weapons from the hands of these samurai and dismantle their threat to our projects,' $n says.
&+G'I will reward you for each jade katana you recover from these highland samurai, $N' he says with a bow, and a solemn nod.
$n grins and asks $N '&+GWhat do you know of the jade &N&+gwyrm&+G?'.
~
