at you to study you for moment as she considers whether to kill you with her
huge hammer.  She softens a bit and finally responds to you...

   'If you want a weapon, bring me some something to work with...but you must
      have some money as well, I don't work for free, you know...

         Bring me obsidian, rubies or emeralds, and i'll give you a weapon
         that will bring death to your enemies...

      If you bring me emeralds, I also want 890 plat...
      If you bring me rubies, I require 400 plat...
      If you bring me obsidian, I want 200 plat...

   And don't bring me uncut emeralds...I can work with uncut rubies or some
    bleak obsidians, but not uncut emeralds...cut those emeralds yourself!

   Now, LEAVE ME ALONE!'
~
