       she makes the head of the mace and while melted, she turns to the
       pile of emeralds.  She takes them and starts to polish them on her
       polishing wheel.  When done, she has several emerald spikes that she
       now embeds into the mace's head.  She plunges the mace into the water
       and pulls out a beautiful mace.
