commander~
As though pondering the depth of your inquiry, he scratches his chin and
descends into deep, deep thought.

A moment later, as if struck by divine inspiration, he bellows out a
popular dwarven tune about the peaks of the north.

He sputters for a few minutes, blathering on about various dwarven root pie
recipies and such, never quite making any sense.

In a moment of clarity he says 'A complete and utter nin-kom-poop!
Absolutley no concern for the feelings of the book, or even his health!
Men such as that should never be charged with the protection of such value.'
