referring'

The strange fellow suddenly screams '&+GBUGS!!!&N Get them off of me!!'

Waving his arms madly in the air, scratching his face and arms, he
continues to scream about insects and bugs flying around in his head.

Without skipping a beat, he ceases his ranting and continues his reply.
He says 'to the book of course, silly of me to assume you were inquiring as
to MY home. Thats not to say you would'nt want to come visit me, I'm a
very social person you know.  If it were'nt for all these'

The strange fellow starts running in circles again, arms flailing about
in the air, all the while screaming 'AAARRRGGGGHHHHH I HATE BUGS!!!! GET
THEM OFF OF ME PLEASE!!!!!!'

Again, not missing a word he continues 'bugs I would have guests over all
the time! I've been told im quite the host.'

He winks at you, knowing you believe every word.

He says 'So back to the original question...umm what was it again oh yes
the books home.  Well I needed some place close by, since I cant keep him
with me for to long, and it had to be warm. Let me see, where did I
place him...ummm....'

Blushing mildly, he says 'I appear to be at a loss. I seem to have forgotten
where I left it! It was just here a minute ago...not that it will do you
any good to know its location, it's mine forever!'
~
