	&+W"Why would you help me?  What is in it for you?  I guess I have little
	&+Wchoice but to trust you, so I'll take my chances...  Another guest at
	&+Wthis inn is a talented alchemist.  He is very adept at creating very
	&+Wpowerful medicines, and I am sure he could save my life.  Though, I am
	&+Wnot sure if I could bear life after the disgrace of losing my father's
	&+Wpendant...  If you can obtain both the &+Rmedicine&+W and the &+Ypendant
