The &+yhalfling's&n eyes widen as he sees the vial and pendant you carry.  As you hand them to him he quickly downs the potion in one quick gulp, and then rubs his fingers over the pendant with an amused grin on his face.  As his strength returns he stands and walks to the back of the room.  Kneeling and fiddling with a loose floorboard, he pries it loose and retrieves something from underneath.  As he walks back towards you, a menacing smile comes into view.

	&+W"When that fat merchant caught me in his room I figured I had lost
	&+Wmy only chance to nab that pendant.  And then when one of his guards
	&+Wcut me, I thought it was all over..."&n

