that the book I wrote on Fonstaf was quite popular, but I forget much of what
was in it. I recall that he was a paladin that ensorcelled a demon, trapping
him within a graveyard somewhere near the Village of Blackwood. I forget how
he died, but I think he has a descendant in a position of power somewhere.
Oh, how old age dulls the mind...&+g"&N
~
